Single-database migration configuration for LedgerOne.

Development may use AUTO_CREATE_SCHEMA=true for a zero-setup local SQLite database.
Production should use AUTO_CREATE_SCHEMA=false and apply these migrations before the web process starts:

    flask --app run.py db upgrade

Create future revisions with:

    flask --app run.py db migrate -m "describe change"

Always inspect autogenerated revisions before committing them.
